        },
        {
          "text": "Mbuboobu mbwaamba Leza, Jehova, iwakalenga ijulu akuliyanzaala, uubambasika nyika azintu zizwa mulinjiyo, uuabila bantu bali alinjiyo kuyooya, abaabo beendeenda mumo ulabapa muuya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.42.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.42.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
