              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hos 7:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nciceeco ncaakamutilila bukali bwakwe bupya ankondo yakwe injumu. Cakamutenta koonse koonse, nekubaboobo takwakaziba. Cakamuumpa, nekubaboobo takwakabika moyo wakwe kumakani.",
          "type": "text",
